rooms_desc ({"Hmmm, this definitely isn't the church. As you look around, you see thatthis is the house of Unuscione, and you wonder what madness you havestumbled upon now... You figure you might as well make the best of things and look around his house.","Your footsteps echo across the green marble floor that you are walkingon as you step into Unuscione's room. Looking at the walls and ceiling,you see that he has painted them black, with green dots varying in size....ah, now you see that this is the universe as he wishes it to be, space with green stars instead of yellow and white. His waterbed sits atthe back of the room with a expensive looking green and black comforterover it. To your right is an in-floor hot tub that he relaxes in frequently.You see an empty bottle of Dom lying next to the hot tub and you wonderhow long it has been there and where Unuscione is now... Past the hot tubis a refrigerator stocked with various alcohols and foods, the best thattmoney can buy. Over on your left is his stereo that he uses to listen tohis favorite music when he feels nostalgic for times gone by. You guess that he must be very comfortable here and that is why he doesn't spendalot of time outside of this house...","This room looks like a cheaply made cartoon, and you really aren'tsurprised to see Beavis and Butt-head sitting on a couch watchingTV, since this IS the house of Unuscione, damn weirdo that he is...They look at you for a moment and seem to be about to say something,but then, a video with some loosely dressed women comes onto the TVand they stare at the TV drooling. After a few minutes, Beavis startsplaying with his lighter. How strange...","As you step out onto the bridge, you realize that the entire room hereis made out of mirrors, the floor, the ceiling, even the bridge thatyou are standing on! You foolishly look over the edge of the bridge,and immediately feel your stomache churn once you realize that you cannot tell how far it is to the floor, or how far up to the ceiling...Upon looking again, you see that the bridge is here to keep you fromfalling into the crystal clear water that comes up to the underside ofthe bridge. What a strange place......","This large room is simply adorned, surprising considering the rest ofUnuscione's house, its only item is a picture of the founder ofIsshinryu Karate, Tatsuo Shimabuku. Even though it is not decorated in amanner as expensive as the rest of the house, this room fills you with ainner peace and powerful determination.","All of a sudden, a brisk chill sweeps your body as you enter Unuscione'swinter room. Snow floats slowly through the air 24 hours a day here, and although there is at least 3 feet of snow on the floor and you werechilled just a minute ago, you now feel comfortable amongst the cool snow.As you take a final look around the room, Unuscione suddenly jumps up infront of you and plasters you with a snowball!","Your eyes try to adjust to the darkness as you enter Unuscione's privatescreening room. This is where he watches newly released movies with hisfriends. At the northern wall is a movie screen, and Bose speakers lineboth the East and West walls. Also near the front are three rows ofplush seats. To your left, there is a popcorn machine, where you can get a bag of fresh, buttery popcorn, free of charge. There is also a sodafountain, next to the popcorn machine. Enjoy the movie!","Upon entering this room, you immediately recognize it to be an asianbath house, having a pool in the middle that is 4 feet deep and filledwith hot water. An immense amount of steam rises from the pool, makingit difficult to see your way around in here, but it is relaxing all thesame. Several large towels sit on a bench near the east wall, in case aguest uses these facilities.","What the hell?! You could have sworn that you were in Unuscione's housea moment ago, but now you are strapped into the Mantis, the world'sfastest, tallest, steepest stand-up rollercoaster at Cedar Point, whereUnuscione worked this summer. Not only are you on this nightmare ofspeed, you are in the front car as well!! The coaster starts up andsends you screaming through the air as the Mantis takes you up, down,sideways, and upside down several times at speeds up to 65 mph. Beingthat you are in the farthest right seat, you also feel like you aregoing to hit every single metal pole that holds this monstrosity up inthe air. After a few moments, the ride is over and you stagger to the exit, with your stomach churning the whole way.","As you take your first step into the room, you realize that you arestanding on a giant slide. You quickly lose your balance, and startto slide the slide at a rather rapid pace. At the bottom, you slaminto a gigantic pit filled with small, plastic balls! You look aroundyou and see nets on all sides going all the way up to the ceiling.You start to feel younger and more energetic...",})
rooms_short ({"This is Unuscione's Greeting Room","This is Unuscione's bedroom","Fire! Fire! Fire!","This is Unuscione's Baffle room.","This is Unuscione's training dojo.","Unuscione's winter room","This is Unuscione's private screening room.","Unuscione's bath and sauna house","This is Unuscione's rollercoaster room.","???",})
